[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Release the accelerator cable (1b), working on the throttle valve\n(1a).</p><p>2. Disconnect the accelerator cable from the mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046223.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Release the accelerator cable (1b) working on the throttle valve\n(1a).</p><p>2. Disconnect the accelerator cable from the mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046223.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the protective cap (1a) for the breather valve on the\nsingle fuel pipe (1b) and discharge the fuel pressure using the\ntool (1c).</p><p>Collect the fuel in a suitable container.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Rapid connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.684.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046224.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the protective cap (1a) for the breather valve for the\nsingle fuel pipe (1b) and discharge the fuel pressure using the\ntool (1c).</p><p>Collect the fuel in a suitable container.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Rapid connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.684.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046224.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70D</strong></p></td></tr></table></di